Server init.

>> DB := Maria-DB አዲስ አስተናጋጅ: ['localhost'],
	የተጠቃሚ-ስም: ['xo'],
	የይለፍ-ቃል: ['pass123'],
	የውሂብ-ጎታ-ስም: ['xobase'],
	ተገናኝ.
	
>> SQL := ['SELECT "hello" AS "world" '].

# a quicker way, get query from DB:
>> query2 := DB መጠይቅ: SQL.

# now you don't have to set DB
query2 አምጣ: { :row
	ውጤት ፃፍ: row world, አዲስ-መስመር.
}.
